{"ID":"20240513083034-c659jfl","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083034-c659jfl","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083034-c659jfl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513170329-kz61c8g\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513170329-kz61c8g\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513170329-kz61c8g\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:646,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:671\u0026#125;","title":"273","type":"doc","updated":"20240515115527"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513170329-kz61c8g","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 1024px;","id":"20240513170329-kz61c8g","updated":"20240515115527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"209-3 L, X"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/05/22"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1. 太陽溫病回診2. 耳後骨腫起"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診：\n1、"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"口渴：無口渴"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小便：小便黃 表示仍有宿便"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3、"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胸滿:有"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4、"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"噁心：沒雖便秘，胸滿卻沒有噁心，故不屬於柴胡湯證"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5、"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"身體：冷， 小腹特別寒"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→陽明腑熱通常下焦不見寒象，此患者陽明腑熱，卻又下焦寒，所謂熱極生寒或久病而產生寒熱並結現象"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6、"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"睡覺：不好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7、"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服前方時，心速無增 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"8、"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無排氣現象"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"9、"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"自從去年五月服用網路減肥方牛肉+山楂湯後就一直發生便秘"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診：浮數有力"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"表情呆滯，被驚嚇的神情"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苔黃厚"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"表寒仍有，陽明腑熱重（大腸），表裏雙解"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服5/20方後，此病人，表證仍有，力爭轉為陽明腑熱證， 此次治則為表裏雙解 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"葛根5錢，麻黃3錢，桂枝4，白芍4，生薑2片，大棗10個 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"葛根湯去炙甘草解表證"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"厚樸2錢，枳實2錢，大黃5錢，芒硝3錢分三包沖服 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"攻陽明腑熱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5付 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"→"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"bf b \u0026 s"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"1． 耳後骨，膝蓋骨，頭蓋骨為骨質末，當我們使用陽藥清身體之毒素時，這些穢氣會往這三個地方排的現象，而後再排出體外"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"2． 此證為表寒仍有，且陽明腑熱重，治則採表裏雙解，方用葛根湯 +大承氣湯，而將葛根湯裏的炙甘草拿掉，否則大承氣湯將成為調胃承氣湯。而且此患者服前劑雖有麻黃，並沒有使其心跳加速， 故方中沒有炙甘草應不影響其心臟問題"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"3． 表裏兩證並病時，先解表，或先攻裏，或表裏雙解，視那一證急，就先治那一證。 此患者我們採取表裏雙解"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"服藥後若汗流很多，有渴的現象可以多吃水梨來補充津液"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]}]}]}]}